## Decision Process:
1. Field_1 has the highest threat level and will soon have 3 drones (1 protecting + 2 flying there), but needs 4 for full protection
2. Field_2 has the second highest threat level and will soon have 2 drones (1 protecting + 1 flying there), but needs 4 for full protection
3. Field_4 already has 2 drones protecting out of 3 needed
4. Field_3 has the lowest threat level and no protection, but only needs 2 drones

Since we have one idle drone (Drone_7) and partial protection isn't very effective, I should prioritize fields that are close to achieving full protection, while considering threat levels.

The most efficient use of our idle drone would be to direct it to Field_1, which has the highest threat level and would then have all 4 drones needed for full protection.

## Final Drone Assignments

